                                "sense_id": "c03937f8-f677-3b71-bb93-03e8dfa83822",
                                "text": "It smote Atrides orbie targe; but runne not through the brasse.\nWhen, now arraid The world was with the spring; and orbie houres Had gone the round againe, through herbs and flowers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4aac4381-b936-440a-9738-42de18845e9b",
                                "sense_id": "c03937f8-f677-3b71-bb93-03e8dfa83822",
                                "text": "Their orbye christales moue\nMore actiue than before,\nAnd entheate from aboue\nTheir soueraigne prince laude, glorifie, adore."
